  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Organising a presentation",
     "texto": [
      "A short presentation can have an **innledning** (introduction), a **hoveddel** (main part) and an **avslutning** (conclusion). Present the idea, give reasons and end with a conclusion."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Justifying an opinion",
     "texto": [
      "**Etter min mening** means «in my opinion». **Begrunne** is to justify; **innvending** is an objection. A conclusion picks up the main idea without repeating the whole text."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
